WEBVTT

00:06:26.330 --> 00:06:30.597
And this makes me very sad because
ventures like this should work

00:06:30.597 --> 00:06:32.130
because they will change the world.

00:06:32.830 --> 00:06:39.163
A second example where we have testing
in the DNA of the company is Tesla.

00:06:39.463 --> 00:06:43.463
From the start, actually, before they
built their first model, the Roadster,

00:06:44.030 --> 00:06:45.663
they tested with customers.

00:06:45.663 --> 00:06:48.663
If there was demand, they
asked customers to make

00:06:48.663 --> 00:06:51.330
a down payment before they even had

00:06:51.330 --> 00:06:55.830
the first model to test if there was
demand. And the rest is history.

00:06:56.230 --> 00:06:59.863
Now, the question is, of course,
is this only for startups?

00:06:59.863 --> 00:07:04.997
Is this only for disruptors who start
from scratch? I don't think so.